<https://w3id.org/rete/datacite#FundingReference> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One fundingReference of one record (<doi>/funding/<n>): what that record says about a funder (dcite:funderName, an identifier not minted as dcite:rawIdentifier) and the funder IRI it points at (dcite:funder). The statements stay on the reference because a ROR or Funder ID IRI is shared by every record that names it, and one record's name for it is not a fact about the others."@en .
