<https://w3id.org/rete/datacite#PidRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A reified relationship event from the DataCite PID Graph ('PID Links' tables): a typed, provenance-bearing edge between a subject and an object PID, with the asserting source and timestamp. One PidRelation is one event, identified by its PID Links uuid as <https://api.datacite.org/events/{uuid}>: it has exactly one relationSubject, relationObject, relationType, assertedBy and occurredAt. Reifying it keeps provenance (source_id) and time that a bare triple would lose."@en .
<https://w3id.org/rete/datacite#PidRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PID relation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/rete/datacite#PidRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity> .
<https://w3id.org/rete/datacite#PidRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:r2 .
